<title>CANADA: CBRS confirms Placer Dome debt ratings.</title>
<headline>CBRS confirms Placer Dome debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service Inc said on Wednesday it confirmed its credit ratings on Placer Dome Inc's short and long-term debt securities.</p>
<p>Short-term securities were confirmed at A-1 and long term securities were confirmed at the A level, CBRS said.</p>
<p>CBRS also said it assigned a B++ rating to the proposed offering of two issues of junior subordinated debentures, series A and series B, with a principal amount of US$150 million each.</p>
<p>The rating outlook was stable.</p>
</text>
